            "review_title": "Review at Dragonfly Bar",
            "review_text": "Matt M\nDarwin, Australia24 contributions\n0\nOk\nSep 2017 • Friends\nGreat atmosphere. But was a little annoyed because my friends were quite tipsy. And as I watched them hand over a $500,000 note. For two drinks under $100,000. They only gave 250,000 change. And then the staff got annoyed with me when I questioned them. Another friend then ordered and payed for shisha. When they brought it over, asked another to pay for it, again. When that was brought up, they took the one we had away, not even having it for 5 mins. And brought a new one. \nBottom line is, I think they were shifty and you should keep a sharp eye on your change. It's the principle, not the $15 they tried to jib us. We left shortly after. Cause I wanted to get drunk too and couldn't trust the staff.\nRead more\nWritten September 3, 2017",
